WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.520
Merry Christmas.

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:02.640
And come back soon.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:03.440
Hey boss.

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:05.140
You know the Christmas baking contest.

00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:05.800
You're always talking about.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:06.560
Ah ha.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:07.200
Tadaa...

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.100
The royal family of Belgravia

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.520
invites you to compete

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.440
in our Christmas baking competition.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:13.780
Can you believe it ?

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:19.440
It's the nut cracker.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.100
Christmas is a magical time of you.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.600
I just wish I had someone to spend it with.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.840
Christmas wishes have been known to come true.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.580
I Am so sorry.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:31.500
No problem.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.440
Who are you ?

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:39.140
Oh Lady Margaret Delacorte Duchess and Montanaro.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.120
Stacy denoble.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.280
I think we were destined to run into each other.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
I'm supposed to marry Prince Edward on New Year's Day,

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.560
But I hate being in the spotlight.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.200
I want to get to know what it's like to be a normal girl.

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:55.080
I want to switch places with the yours.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:55.860
Switch places.

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:57.120
I become you.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:57.620
And

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:58.820
You become me.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.200
Get out

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:04.440
It will only be for two days.

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.620
No one would even notice.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:07.960
Stacy de novo.

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:09.000
How's it hanging?

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.500
How's it hanging ?

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:11.760
amazed.marches is it ?

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:14.880
I suppose its time

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.120
If you to say something.

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:17.520
Oh, here you are ?

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:18.520
Here, I am.

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:22.240
I'm determined to spend as much time together as we can over the next few days.

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:23.200
How

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.180
Smashing.

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:27.000
Breakfast is ready.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.000
You never burn anything.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.740
I guess I'm a bit nervous

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:31.740
with the

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:32.940
big contest coming up.

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:38.100
Here we go.

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:42.700
Oh, are you alright ?

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:46.940
Keep a close eye on the Duchess.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.360
She seems some....

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:49.320
different.

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:51.380
Oh

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:52.700
Uh terribly sorry

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:54.240
That wasn't very dignified.

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:54.820
It's alright.

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:56.680
Quite liked it actually.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.160
Christmas should be about love.

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.800
I've never seen you so sentimental.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:03.120
Maybe you don't know me that well.

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:07.560
I didn't think things would get so complicated.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.200
So what do we do?

00:02:19.340 --> 00:02:20.780
I don't know if I can keep this up.

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:23.920
Everything. Okay?

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:24.580
Yep.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:26.060
I'm great.

